{
  "bookId": "hero-215201",
  "id": "bond-29303",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29303001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "周瑜找你告我状了，是吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29303002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你怎么知道？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29303003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "主公忽然买了很多蔬菜种子，很难不让我深思啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29303004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "除了周瑜，我想应该不会有人告诉主公，我喜欢什么蔬菜吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "29303006",
              "text": "被你猜中了。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "29303006",
              "text": "周瑜说你拿人情要挟他，要他陪你去种菜呢。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "29303005",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29303006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "……他是不是还请你一起来种菜？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29303007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29303008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "是不是还请你吃饭，让你付账？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29303009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……没错。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29303010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "依我所见，唯有菜地，才治得了周瑜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29303011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "不当家，不知柴米油盐贵，不种地，怎知平民百姓苦。\n最重要的是——出门吃饭总是要我来付账，最可恶了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29303012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "主公，你说对吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29303013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你说的没错。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29303014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "所以，我们现在就去将周瑜抓来种菜吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29303015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "相信他一定可以在辛苦的劳动中，重新做人的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "29303",
